bring ilk/one.tung
bring ilk/or.tung

## file access. a misfare yieldeth its error message on the left.
show let read: [string, (string ∨ string) deed] ≔ 'read_file' fremmed

show let write: [string, string, (string ∨ 𝟙) deed] ≔ 'write_file' fremmed

show let onhang: [string, string, (string ∨ 𝟙) deed] ≔ 'onhang_file' fremmed
